          text: "先展示原始值，再按真实格式解析。无法解析的记录用 quiet = TRUE 暂时变成 NA，随后单独回查。",
          code: `library(lubridate)\nraw_date <- c(\"2024-01-15\", \"2024/02/20\", \"20240115\", \"invalid\")\nparsed <- ymd(raw_date, quiet = TRUE)\ntibble::tibble(raw = raw_date, parsed, failed = is.na(parsed))`,
          explain: "ymd() 能识别多种分隔写法和连续 8 位写法。quiet = TRUE 避免逐条警告，但必须统计 failed。",
