          code: `follow <- tibble::tibble(\n  enroll = ymd(c(\"2024-01-01\", \"2024-02-10\")),\n  event = ymd(c(\"2024-04-01\", NA)),\n  last_visit = ymd(c(\"2024-05-01\", \"2024-08-20\"))\n) |>\n  mutate(\n    end_date = coalesce(event, last_visit),\n    status = as.integer(!is.na(event)),\n    follow_days = as.numeric(end_date - enroll)\n  )`,
          explain: "coalesce() 优先使用事件日期，没有事件时使用最后随访日期；status 明确区分事件和删失。",
