          code: `set.seed(2026)\nimp <- mice(dat, m = 20, maxit = 20, method = method, predictorMatrix = pred, printFlag = FALSE)\nplot(imp)`,
          explain: "m 是插补套数，maxit 是每套迭代数。轨迹应混合而非持续漂移，但仍需结合数据和模型判断。",
